tem Listrik / Electrical System]\nBattere / Accu (V-Ah): 12V-100Ah x 1", "Foton Aumark S": "Type: Foton Aumark S\nModel: BJ1088VEJEA-FR\nEngine: Cummins ISF3.8s4R154\nType: Diesel, Turbocharged, Intercooled, Four-Stroke\nCylinders: 4 In-Line\nDisplacement: 3.76L\nMax Output: 154 PS (115 kW) @ 2,600 rpm\nMax Torque: 500 N-m @ 1,200–1,900 rpm\nEmission: Euro 4\nFuel Injection: ECU Controlled High Pressure Common Rail (Bosch)\nTransmission: ZF6S508T0, 6-Speed Manual\nGear Ratios: 1st 6.198; 2nd 3.287; 3rd 2.025; 4th 1.371; 5th 1.000; 6th 0.780; Reverse 5.681; Final 4.333\nGW: 8,250 kg\nCurb Weight: 2,995 kg\nFuel Tank: 200L\nFront Axle: Reversed Elliot I-Beam (4,000 kg)\nRear Axle: Banjo Type Full Floating (6,500 kg)\nFront Suspension: 8-Leaf Spring + Hydraulic Double Acting Shock Absorber\nRear Suspension: 8+6 Leaf Spring + Hydraulic Double Acting Shock Absorber\nTyres: 7.50R16\nWheels: 16 x 6.00\nService Brake: Air Braking Dual Circuit with ABS\nParking Brake: Pneumatic Controlled Spring Brake\nAuxiliary Brake: Exhaust Brake\nSteering: Hydraulic Power Assisted\nTurning Radius: 6.7m\nBattery: 24V 100AH (2 pcs)\nWheelbase: 3,360 mm\nLength: 5,960 mm\nWidth: 2,030 mm\nHeight: 2,260 mm\nFront Overhang: 1,110 mm\nRear Overhang: 1,420 mm\nFront Tread: 1,590 mm\nRear Tread: 1,534 mm", "Isuzu NMR HD 5.8": "Type: Isuzu NMR HD 5.8\n[Dimensi]\nPanjang / Overall Length (OAL) (mm): 6,000\nLebar / Overall Width (OW) (mm): 1,990\nTinggi / Overall Height (OH) (mm): 2,345\nJarak Sumbu / Wheelbase (WB) (mm): 3,360\nJulur Depan / Front Overhang (FOH) (mm): 1,110\nJulur Belakang / Rear Overhang (ROH) (mm): 1,530\nJarak Terendah ke Tanah / Minimum Clearance (HH) (mm): 200\nJejak Depan / Front Tread (AW) (mm): 1,475\nJejak Belakang / Rear Tread (CW) (mm): 1,495\nCabin to End (CE) (mm): 4,395\n[Mesin]\nModel: 4HL1-TCS\nTipe / Type: Direct Injection, Commonrail, SOHC, 4 Cylinder, VGS Turbo Intercooler\nSistem Kontrol Emisi: EURO4 with EGR & DOC\nDiameter x Langkah / Bore x Stroke (mm): 115x115\nIsi Silinder / Piston Displacement (cc): 4,778\nTenaga Maksimum / Maximum Power (PS/rpm): 150 / 2,600\nTorsi Maksimum / Maximum Torque (Kgm/rpm): 41/1,400 - 2,600\n[Transmisi]\nModel: MYY6S\nPerbandingan Gigi / Gear Ratio - 1st: 5.979\nPerbandingan Gigi / Gear Ratio - 2nd: 3.434\nPerbandingan Gigi / Gear Ratio - 3rd: 1.862\nPerbandingan Gigi / Gear Ratio - 4th: 1.297\nPerbandingan Gigi / Gear Ratio - 5th: 1.000\nPerbandingan Gigi / Gear Ratio - 6th: 0.759\nPerbandingan Gigi / Gear Ratio - Rev: 5.701\n[Berat]\nBerat Kosong Kendaraan / Curb Weight (kg): 2,570\nBerat Total Kendaraan / Gross Vehicle Weight [GVW] (kg): 8,250\nKapasitas Gardan Depan / Capacity Front Axle (kg): 2,710\nKapasitas Gardan Belakang / Capacity Rear Axle (kg): 5,540\n[Brake]\nTipe / Type: Hydraulic\nRem Kaki / Service Brake: Hydraulic, saluran ganda dengan vacuum booster\nRem Tangan / Hand Brake: Expanding pada transmisi belakang\nSistem Pengereman Gas Buang / Exhaust Brake: Exhaust brake, tuas berada di stir\n[Tyre]\nUkuran Ban: 7.50-16-14PR\nUkuran Velg: 16 x 6.00\n[Suspensi]\nTipe: Semi elliptical laminated leaf spring dengan shock absorber berdaya ganda", "Isuzu NMR HD 6.5": "Type: Isuzu NMR HD 6.5\n[Dimensi]\nPanjang / Overall Length (OAL) (mm): 6,000\nLebar / Overall Width (OW) (mm): 1,990\nTinggi / Overall Height (OH) (mm): 2,345\nJarak Sumbu / Wheelbase (WB) (mm): 3,360\nJulur Depan / Front Overhang (FOH) (mm): 1,110\nJulur Belakang / Rear Overhang (ROH) (mm): 1,530\nJarak Terendah ke Tanah / Minimum Clearance (HH) (mm): 200\nJejak Depan / Front Tread (AW) (mm): 1,475\nJejak Belakang / Rear Tread (CW) (mm): 1,495\nCabin to End (CE) (mm): 4,395\n[Mesin]\nModel: 4HL1-TCS\nTipe / Type: Direct Injection, Commonrail, SOHC, 4 Cylinder, VGS Turbo Intercooler\nSistem Kontrol Emisi: EURO4 with EGR & DOC\nDiameter x Langkah / Bore x Stroke (mm): 115x115\nIsi Silinder / Piston Displacement (cc): 4,778\nTenaga Maksimum / Maximum Power (PS/rpm): 150 / 2,600\nTorsi Maksimum / Maximum Torque (Kgm/rpm): 41/1,400 - 2,600\n[Transmisi]\nModel: MYY6S\nPerbandingan Gigi / Gear Ratio - 1st: 5.979\nPerbandingan Gigi / Gear Ratio - 2nd: 3.434\nPerbandingan Gigi / Gear Ratio - 3rd: 1.862\nPerbandingan Gigi / Gear Ratio - 4th: 1.297\nPerbandingan Gigi / Gear Ratio - 5th: 1.000\nPerbandingan Gigi / Gear Ratio - 6th: 0.759\nPerbandingan Gigi / Gear Ratio - Rev: 5.701\nPerbandingan Gigi Terakhir / Final Gear Ratio: 6.500\nPerbandingan Gigi Terakhir / Final Gear Ratio: 5.857\n[Berat]\nBerat Kosong Kendaraan / Curb Weight (kg): 2,570\nBerat Total Kendaraan / Gross Vehicle Weight [GVW] (kg): 8,250\nKapasitas Gardan Depan / Capacity Front Axle (kg): 2,710\nKapasitas Gardan Belakang / Capacity Rear Axle (kg): 5,540\n[Brake]\nTipe / Type: Hydraulic\nRem Kaki / Service Brake: Hydraulic, saluran ganda dengan vacuum booster\nRem Tangan / Hand Brake: Expanding pada transmisi belakang\nSistem Pengereman Gas Buang / Exhaust Brake: Exhaust brake, tuas berada di stir\n[Tyre]\nUkuran Ban: 7.50-16-14PR\nUkuran Velg: 16 x 6.00\n[Suspensi]\nTipe: Semi elliptical laminated leaf spring dengan shock absorber berdaya ganda", "Tata Ultra T.7": "Type: Tata Ultra T.7\n[A. Spesifikasi Sasis Utama (General)]\nModel Kendaraan: Tata ULTRA T.7 Euro 4\nMesin / Engine Description: 3.3L NG D, Euro 4, 3,300 cc\nTenaga Maksimum: 155 PS @ 2,600 rpm\nTorsi Maksimum: 450 Nm @ 1,500 - 2,200 rpm\nKelistrikan / Alternator: Aki 2x12V, 100 Ah / Alternator 24V\nKopling & Transmisi: Single plate dry friction type (330 mm dia) / Tata G-550, 6F+1R Manual\nSistem Kemudi / Rem: Integral Hydraulic Power Steering / Dual Circuit Full Air S-Cam brakes with ABS\nSistem Suspensi: Parabolic leaf spring (Depan) & Semi-elliptical (Belakang)\nUkuran Ban / Roda: 215/75 R17.5\nKapasitas Tangki BBM: 90 Litres\nDimensi Sasis (WB / OAL / OW): Wheelbase: 3,550 mm / Panjang: 6,440 mm / Lebar: 2,050 mm\nMaks. Permissible GVW: 7,490 kg\nPerforma (Gradeability / Max Speed): 45% / 105 kmph (Turning radius 6.5 m)\nFasilitas Kabin: Air Conditi